sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Engineer
    participant Web as Internal Portal
    participant IdP as Okta / SSO Provider
    participant Vault as HashiCorp Vault
    participant Kube as Production Kube API

    User->>Web: Request Cluster Access
    Web->>IdP: Redirect to OIDC Authentication
    IdP-->>User: Prompt MFA (FIDO2 / WebAuthn)
    User->>IdP: Provide Biometric Token
    IdP-->>Web: Return Signed JWT ID Token
    Web->>Vault: Exchange JWT for Short-Lived Cert
    Vault-->>Web: Issue 1-Hour TLS Client Cert
    Web-->>User: Configure kubectl Context
    User->>Kube: kubectl get pods --namespace=production
    Kube-->>User: 200 OK (Pod List)
